#!   SUPPRESS_UPGRADE="false"
#!   TITLE="LantmaterietAPIAccessTokenFetcher"
#!   USAGE="&lt;p&gt;Create an Application, subscribe to the relevant API:s and generate keys for your application at:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apimanager.lantmateriet.se/store&quot;&gt;https://apimanager.lantmateriet.se/store/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Input the application&apos;s Consumer Key and Consumer Secret as parameters.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;Parameters&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;API_KEY&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&quot;Consumer Key&quot; from the Application at https://apimanager.lantmateriet.se/store.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;API_SECRET&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&quot;Consumer Secret&quot; from the Application at https://apimanager.lantmateriet.se/store.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;OPTIONAL_SCOPE&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;A single application may generate tokens for multiple scopes (e g for multiple clients). Tokens generated for a specific scope must be used along with their scopes in further requests.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;API_BASE_URL&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;The base URL for the API endpoints, e g https://api.lantmateriet.se&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;API_TOKEN_URL&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;The API&apos;s token generation endpoint (excluding the base URL)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;API_TOKEN_REVOKE_URL&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;The API&apos;s endpoint for revoking tokens (excluding the base URL)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;MINIMUM_TOKEN_LIFETIME&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Tokens with &lt;em&gt;expires_in&lt;/em&gt; less than this number will be revoked and a new token is generated.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;License&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT&quot;&gt;MIT License&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Copyright © 2021, Mattias Spångmyr, Haninge kommun.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy&#10;of this software and associated documentation files (the &quot;Software&quot;), to deal&#10;in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights&#10;to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell&#10;copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is&#10;furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all&#10;copies or substantial portions of the Software.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED &quot;AS IS&quot;, WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR&#10;IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,&#10;FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE&#10;AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER&#10;LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,&#10;OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE&#10;SOFTWARE.&lt;/p&gt;"
